/Type /StructElem
/S /P
/P 131 0 R
/E (Successfully designed and simulated a Digital Access Card Verification System using combinational logic circuits. The system demonstrated secure and efficient authentication through encoded card credentials and logic gate-based verification. Results confirm reliable access control with minimal latency. The modular architecture ensures scalability for real-world deployment in campuses, labs, and secure facilities. This project validates the practical application of digital logic design in modern security systems.)
/Pg 19 0 R
/K [1]
